                               skip and test tables; the check-config table became kit/.gate/protected.
  kit/.gate/bin/lib/rules.mjs  a dependency-free port of the matcher in plugin/server/safety/handin.ts:
                               parseDiff, maskOf, layerOf, lineFindings (with the hard-coded secret check and
                               entropy), assertionsDropped and the test-deleted finding;
                               the ASSERTION pattern of plugin/server/safety/council/gaming.ts.
