                               answersInSource, the dependency and related-test readers, the finding store and
                               its acknowledgements, which the line comment `gate-allow <rule>: <reason>`
                               replaces. Added here: the Failing-test guard.

pstack (https://github.com/cursor/plugins, path pstack): what the pstack pack takes from it is in packs/pstack/NOTICE.

