2026-10-24).

  kit/.gate/bin/lib/      plugin/content/prompts/REVIEWER.md:12-17, 18-56, 70-84 ("Never", "Reviewing a commit" with
  reviewer-prompt.md      its re-review paragraphs, "The verdict"), word for word, each section under its own heading;
                          the prompt carries no provenance comments, since the reviewer's model reads it (#203, K6).
